octoshield (1.2.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Let interactive changes wait for bounded status collection, give waiting
    changes priority over new readers, and retain exclusive mutation locking.
  * Bound manual status inspections and recover stalled observation workers
    without stopping firewall or USB enforcement.
  * Reuse verified USB inventories to reduce repeated background polling work.
  * Cover runtime lock contention and upgrades from published 1.2.1 packages.

